    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27016" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δίκτυννα</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκτυον</span>) epith. of Artemis as <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>goddess of the chase,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.59
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				145
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δικτυνναῖος</span></b> , ὁ
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>), name of month in Crete, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5173
			</span></i>.</div>
